# Populated shelf after `kobo frame init --sim` and `kobo frame push … --sim`.
expect Frame
expect Photographs
expect-missing Your frame is empty
expect-missing kobo frame
# "Open" also matches the loading message "Opening this photograph".
# Next appears alongside the real Open button after the photo has loaded.
wait-for Next
clean
shot shelf
tap Open
wait 800
expect-missing Open
expect-missing Your frame is empty
clean
shot photo
# Settings are a named control in the bar, every choice on one screen.
tap Back
wait-for Photographs
tap Settings
wait-for Change the photo every
expect Frame mode
expect Slow slideshow
expect By date
clean
shot settings
tap 5 minutes
tap Back
wait-for Photographs
